  "notes": "First real Learn by Doing pass. Damage from mapped weapon types raises native weapon-perk ranks and parent attributes. Confirmed rifle, bow and pistol headshots add a bounded bonus. Existing useful craft, harvest, repair, upgrade and quest routes award practice. Existing ranks stay; unspent points are banked while enabled and restored when disabled. Preview counters migrate once. Learn by Doing defaults on when no preference exists; its speed remains adjustable. Native rank gates are retained. Specialized action routes and balance remain under live playtest.",
